            "review_text": "u07\nUnited States173 contributions\n0\nCheap and delicious plant-based food\nMar 2019\nBy Vietnamese standard, this place is really cheap and well maintained. The restaurant is clean.\n There’s plenty of options for Vietnamese food. All the dishes are vegan and really tasty. \nWe went to this place at about 3 pm since our flight came in a bit late and it’s still open. We had plenty of food for about $5 total.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 26, 2019",
